  "abstract": "Covers the MCP Apps extension (SEP-1865, io.modelcontextprotocol/ui) at its Stable 2026-01-26 specification, pinned at ext-apps v2.0.3: ui:// HTML resources with the text/html;profile=mcp-app MIME type and _meta.ui CSP, permissions, domain and border metadata; tool linkage through _meta.ui.resourceUri and visibility; capability negotiation and text fallback; the postMessage JSON-RPC bridge with ui/initialize, host context and capabilities, tool input and result notifications, view requests, display modes, theming and teardown; the web sandbox proxy, CSP construction and security considerations; and the @modelcontextprotocol/ext-apps SDK. Version lines: 2026-01-26 is current, the pre-stable SEP-1865 drafts are legacy with an upgrade path, and the draft is a preview with posture name. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out the version lines, UI resources, the host bridge, security and sandboxing, and the SDK.",
